WEBVTT

1
00:00:14,130 --> 00:00:16,130
How do you feel when you wake up?

2
00:00:16,130 --> 00:00:19,770
Fortunately, I can’t die. Thank you.

3
00:00:19,770 --> 00:00:22,180
It's daybreak. We can't stay long.

4
00:00:22,180 --> 00:00:31,640
Can you still go this way?

5
00:00:31,640 --> 00:00:41,590
No, what's going on?
